As an exception to the above, the final design GDS is also dual-licensed
under Apache 2.0 for compliance with TinyTapeout requirements. This
applies only to the final GDS and not to any of the sources files
used to generate it.


# AI

## Text and Data Mining (TDM) Restriction
Pursuant to Article 4(3) of the EU Copyright Directive (2019/790), the
author(s) explicitly reserve all rights for text and data mining, machine
learning training, and artificial intelligence model development. Any
automated scraping, processing, or reproduction of this repository's
contents for AI training purposes is strictly prohibited without prior
written authorization.

## Other
In general all material here has all rights reserved and the author
doesn't consider AI training or other AI uses of the repository to be
fair use. All products (model and its output) are considered to be
derived works if any of the material here is used in the process.
